199	  // `NIX_PACKAGES` is the declared tooling for this deployment. A declared tool
200	  // is not necessarily provisioned by nix: the production image bakes `git` and
201	  // `gh` into /usr/bin (see docker/app/Dockerfile), which is on PATH but not
